      "value": "@{62fbd306dbae6a44a9f7423d|full_name}: How is this not a bug? From my experience with this issue, it makes VRChat pretty much unusable with wireless earbuds. After ~10 minutes everyone's audio suddenly stops, and doesn't come back on until you restart your game. I've noticed that the Quest's audio, as well as some sound effects played by VRChat worlds (as well as the VRChat menu sound effects), continue to play, but you can't hear anyone's voices.\nDisconnecting the earbuds (and going to the Quest's loudspeaker) brings the audio back, but it's gone once more after reconnecting the earbuds. The only way to fix this is with a restart of the game.",
